<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/767ccb5adc0f> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "“We, the NGOs, urge the government to immediately stop the establishment of a biometric monitoring system that is not only illegal but also significantly violates international human rights norms,” wrote Advocates for Public Interest Law, MINBYUN - Lawyers for a Democratic Society, the Institute for Digital Rights, the Joint Committee with Migrants in Korea, and the Korean Progressive Network Jinbonet, in a press release that was translated and provided to Motherboard." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2262" .

